  "explanation": "The question asks when the *Freaky Friday* musical began its performances. Two distinct dates are directly stated in the sources: D1S1 states the musical began at the Signature Theatre on **October 4, 2016**, and D1S5 and D2S5 state it began at the La Jolla Playhouse on **January 31, 2017**. These are two separate venues and represent distinct performance runs, so both are valid answers. D2S1 claims a start date of January 1, 2018, at the same venue as D1S1, but this conflicts with the earlier claim and lacks additional supporting context to justify inclusion alongside the confirmed 2016 and 2017 dates."
